{"id":"587fa3c5f12ce89b","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ck.md","title":"有限变量计数量词逻辑 C^k","display":"df-ck — 有限变量计数量词逻辑 C^k","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ck","aliases":["29-df-ck"],"display":"df-ck — 有限变量计数量词逻辑 C^k","depends_on":["[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","[[29-df-variable]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"§12.3, p.187, DjVu scan 202","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层已独立提取比对；本条实际核对及本地重构范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ck"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ck</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ck — 有限变量计数量词逻辑 C^k"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"19d380b6c383f76b\" href=\"?note=19d380b6c383f76b\" title=\"29-df-atomic-formula\">29-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§12.3, p.187, DjVu scan 202"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层已独立提取比对；本条实际核对及本地重构范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 取本书FO语法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条采用单排序计数量词记法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi\">\\((\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为语法中的固定整数阈值；它不占变量名，也不取对象域中元素。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau\\)</span> 只在本条的原子基例使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}\">\\(\\operatorname{vars}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}_C\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}_C\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_C\">\\(\\models_C\\)</span> 由下式在扩张语法上递归引入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta[a/x]\">\\(\\beta[a/x]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a> 的赋值更新。原子满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；全部布尔及量词构造子都在下式中给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_C[\\tau]\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_C[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>；这些布尔构造和全称量词直接按以下规则解释。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K^0_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\quad\\mathcal K^{j+1}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathcal K^j_\\tau\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal K^j_\\tau,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,\\phi,\\forall x\\,\\phi,(\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\phi\\in\\mathcal K^j_\\tau\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Fml}_C[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_j\\mathcal K^j_\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K^0_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\quad\\mathcal K^{j+1}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathcal K^j_\\tau\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal K^j_\\tau,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,\\phi,\\forall x\\,\\phi,(\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\phi\\in\\mathcal K^j_\\tau\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Fml}_C[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_j\\mathcal K^j_\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\alpha),\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{vars}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\alpha),\\qquad\\operatorname{fv}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{vars}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{vars}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}((\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{vars}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{vars}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{vars}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}((\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}((\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fv}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}((\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C^k_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_C[\\tau]\\mid\\operatorname{card}(\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi))\\leq k\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Sent}_{C^k}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in C^k_\\tau\\mid\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C^k_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_C[\\tau]\\mid\\operatorname{card}(\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi))\\leq k\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Sent}_{C^k}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in C^k_\\tau\\mid\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_C\\alpha[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models\\alpha[\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_C\\alpha[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\models\\alpha[\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_C\\neg\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_C(\\phi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta]\\land A\\models_C\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_C\\neg\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta]),\\qquad A\\models_C(\\phi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta]\\land A\\models_C\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_C\\exists x\\,\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;(A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta[a/x]]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_C\\exists x\\,\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;(A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta[a/x]]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_C(\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{card}(\\{a\\in|A|\\mid A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta[a/x]]\\})\\geq m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_C(\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{card}(\\{a\\in|A|\\mid A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta[a/x]]\\})\\geq m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\alpha)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\max(\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi),\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\psi)),\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{qr}_C((\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi),\\quad\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\alpha)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi),\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\max(\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi),\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\psi)),\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{qr}_C((\\exists^{\\geq m}x)\\phi)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi),\\quad\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{vars}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}(\\psi),\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\max(\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi),\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\psi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{vars}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}(\\psi),\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\max(\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi),\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\psi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\cup\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{fv}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{vars}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\cup\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{fv}(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\forall x\\,\\phi)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_C(\\phi\\circ\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta])\\circ(A\\models_C\\psi[\\beta])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_C(\\phi\\circ\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta])\\circ(A\\models_C\\psi[\\beta])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_C\\forall x\\,\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta[a/x]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_C\\forall x\\,\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta[a/x]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_C\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta],\\quad\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_C\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;A\\models_C\\phi[\\beta],\\quad\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷页187、扫描页202将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^k\">\\(C^k\\)</span> 引为附加数值常量的有限变量计数片段；这里采用其在普通有限结构比较中使用的标准单排序计数量词接口，整数阈值作为语法常量。它与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"73b9dab9126dbc32\" href=\"?note=73b9dab9126dbc32\" title=\"29-df-fo-count\">29-df-fo-count</a> 的双排序可变量阈值逻辑分别命名，不能直接把FO的FV/BV作用于未知计数语法。固定阈值量词在无变量限制时可展开为FO，但展开一般增加变量数，故有限变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^k\">\\(C^k\\)</span> 不坍缩为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^k\">\\(L^k\\)</span>。本轮将原子基例和全部满足递归子句写入 Assertion；有限公式树递归保证各函数及真值唯一，阈值零时计数式恒真。原书页187已视觉核对，花体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^k\">\\(L^k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^k\">\\(C^k\\)</span> 不依赖 OCR 字形判别。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],