:"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\equiv_{G,m}$、$\\equiv_{G,\\infty}$ 取 [[29-df-vertex-refinement]]；$C^2_{\\tau_r}$、$\\operatorname{vars}$、$\\operatorname{fv}$、$\\mathrm{qr}_C$、$\\models_C$ 取 [[29-df-ck]]。"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ck]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ck]]"}],"outgoing":["19d380b6c383f76b","ad08b66c5e54a436","db2b32546860e623","3ee556c64b16809b","ac5c4072279f0088","4de8e0c8085801f5","73b9dab9126dbc32"]}